  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Employment and Entrepreneurship Capability through Improving the Youth IT Education Ecosystem in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IT and English Proficiency Training, Infrastructure Enhancement, Creation of BPO Center, Curriculum Development, Capacity Enhancement, Operation Plan</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the project is to empower young individuals with crucial skills in IT, logistics, English, and Korean languages, thereby enabling them to obtain employment at the BPO center, planned to be built in one of Uzbekistans less economically developed regions. Moreover, the project aims to enhance digital literacy and reduce the digital gap among the local population by providing equipment and renovation of the buildings of 94 Digital Technology Education Centers across the country.&#x25a3; 1 &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xd658;&#xacbd; &#xc870;&#xc131;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; IT &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;
&#x25a3; 2 &#xc18c;&#xc678;&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xccad;&#xc18c;&#xb144; IT &#xad50;&#xc721;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xcde8;&#xcc3d;&#xc5c5;/&#xb300;&#xd559; &#xc9c4;&#xd559; &#xae30;&#xd68c; &#xc99d;&#xb300;</narrative>
  </description>
